  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MG - Second Inclusive and Resilient Growth DPO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program development objective of this programmatic operation is to tackle the micro-foundations of inclusive and resilient growth by (i) strengthening the resilience of individuals against shocks and (ii) creating an enabling environment for economic opportunities in rural communities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program document is for a second inclusive and resilient growth development policy operation (DPO) for Madagascar. The development objective of this programmatic operation is to tackle the microfoundations of inclusive and resilient growth by (i) strengthening the resilience of individuals against shocks; and (ii) creating an enabling environment for economic opportunities in rural communities. This Inclusive and resilient growth DPO series helps Madagascar tackle one of its key challenges today - ensuring that the poor can benefit more from the country&apos;s continuing improved macroeconomic prospects: (i) The first pillar seeks to build the foundations for resilience at the individual and household level; and (ii) The second pillar focuses on enabling rural inclusion, by supporting economic opportunities in local communities.</narrative>
  </description>
